                                                "sense_id": "a8ebfa69-eacb-3d2e-9085-000409a1fe45",
                                                "text": "for feare least blame / Of her miscarriage should in her be fond, / She wist not how t'amend, nor how it to withstond."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "47c9cfe9-793a-3af6-8a17-b3cd9c3f762d",
